Redis Hash for Student Details

Write a Python program to store the following student details in a Redis Hash: Roll No: 101,Name: Rahul,Course: BCA,Marks: 85
Perform the following:

Display all student details. 
Display only the student's name.
Update the marks to 90. 
Delete the course field.



1.Create the student hash

student = { "roll_no": 101, "name": "Rahul",
"course": "BCA", "marks": 85
}
r.hset("student:101", mapping=student) 
print("Student details stored successfully")

2.Display all student details

print(r.hgetall("student:101"))

3.Display only the student's name

print("Name:", r.hget("student:101", "name"))

4.Update marks to 90

r.hset("student:101", "marks", 90)
print("Marks updated successfully") 
print("Marks:", r.hget("student:101", "marks"))

5.Delete the course field

r.hdel("student:101", "course") 
print("Course field deleted") 
print(r.hgetall("student:101"))
